      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10820071::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed governing behavior applies over 600–900 °C but may change when additional phase transformations occur.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9414008::web::008::1_introduction",
        "PMC10820071::web::005::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The controlled intervention is to compare high-oxygen-partial-pressure exposure with an H2-rich reducing atmosphere.",
